                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">25</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">In this example model, we use the Selection Input component to create several boxes that can be clicked on in the viewer.

When one of the boxes is clicked on, we draw a flat border around it, and we show a color parameter corresponding to the selected box.</item>
                  </items>
